             systems; nothing in hitorro-core uses them. hitorro-basefile now
             declares what it needs (AWS SDK v2 for S3; Hadoop optional, for
             HDFS). -->
        <!-- The SLF4J binding for reload4j. It used to arrive through Hadoop;
             declared here so logging keeps working without it. Spring Boot
